  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 - 2026-04-27\n\n- Added XML documentation across Monetra.Core public API to improve usability and maintainability.\n- Updated Currency class — added NumericCode, renamed DecimalPlaces → MinorUnits, changed Symbols type, introduced Parse/TryParse, and made equality case-insensitive.\n- Refactored Percentage into a record struct with factory-only creation, improved multiplier-based operations, added strategy-based Round(), renamed Of() → ApplyTo(), and removed legacy multiplier methods.\n- Added financial rounding strategies (Ceiling, Floor, Cash, Composite) and built-in registry for common modes.",
